efault&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Poppins||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;justified&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p>Yogi Amitesh is an experienced sound healer and yoga teacher who has in-depth knowledge of both traditional methods as well as latest developments in his field. He has dedicated more than 15 years of effort into creating comprehensive yoga and sound healing therapy programs that can address the underlying causes of a wide range of mental, emotional, and physical illnesses. His specialty is using different sound frequencies of Tibetan singing bowls to heal trauma from the past, open the blockages of the energy channels, and train aspiring sound healers. His sound healing course trains the aspirants to understand the passive approach of spiritual growth in sound healing philosophy. He also teaches the skill of the application of various sound frequencies in various contexts and design result oriented modules for maximum benefits of the participants during sound healing sessions. Yogi Amitesh is an assertive teacher who respects each student&#8217;s privacy, safety, and uniqueness while offering them smooth assistance throughout their sound healing journey.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;0px||0px|||&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_divider divider_position=&#8221;center&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_divider][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_4,3_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_image src=&#8221;https:\/\/purnamyogashala.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/amitesh-1-768&#215;1024.jpeg&#8221; title_text=&#8221;sound healing india&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; alt=&#8221;sound healing india&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;][\/et_pb_image][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=&#8221;3_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.0&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Poppins||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#000000&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;15px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;justified&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; inline_fonts=&#8221;Poppins&#8221;]<\/p>\n<p><strong>Sound Healing Retreat<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Our sound healing retreat offers you an unforgettable opportunity to experience soul-nourishing sound healing close to stunning beaches of Goa. Yogi Amitesh will guide you to achieve the balance of the natural rhythms within your body using the frequencies of the Tibetan singing bowls. Singing bowls and gongs have entrancing tones that can release psychological blockages and instill a sense of safety and security. Your routine will begin each day with the singing bowls&#8217; soothing tones that will send forth vibrations to balance your energy channels. After attending this retreat, you will immediately experience mental relaxation, a decrease in tension and anxiety, improved sleep, and emotional release. Our sound healing retreat has an enjoyable and supportive atmosphere that is ideal for reviving your vitality and escaping the negativity of everyday life.<\/p>\n<p><strong>What you will get?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Daily sound healing sessions<\/li>\n<li>Yoga and meditation classes<\/li>\n<li>Accommodation and food<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Sound Healing Course<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Yogi Amitesh has created the sound healing coursework to assist you in learning the skills required to engage in therapeutic sound healing and advance in the alternative health industry. The fundamental principle behind sound healing is the synchronization of the body&#8217;s rhythms with the frequencies of various sound-producing instruments. This principle suggests that the rhythmic imbalance in the body is the root cause of various physical and mental diseases. You can develop the awareness of various sound frequencies with the aid of specialized sound-producing instruments and use this skill for treatment of these diseases. This course is suitable for people who have no prior experience in this field as well as for experienced people who are hoping to broaden their horizon by earning a sound healing certification. This course will provide you with the knowledge necessary to pursue a career as a sound healer, making it well worth the money.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Coursework<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduction to fundamental philosophy of sound healing<\/li>\n<li>In-depth knowledge of different sound tools and vocal toning<\/li>\n<li>Healing notes and their effect on body and mind<\/li>\n<li>Awareness of the seven chakras and their frequencies<\/li>\n<li>Chakras cleansing and balancing<\/li>\n<li>In-depth therapeutic application of sound healing<\/li>\n<li>Healing session to address specific health concern<\/li>\n<li>Conducting individual and group healing sessions<\/li>\n<li>Designing personalized sound therapy programs<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large; font-family: Poppins; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"t