 Director<\/p><p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"3_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_font=\"Jost||||||||\" text_text_color=\"#212529\" text_font_size=\"16px\" text_line_height=\"1.8em\" text_orientation=\"justified\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"]<\/p><p>Manoj\u2019s teachings are profound; they sensitively deliver, to all abilities and ages, strong, powerful, and empowering sessions which support practitioners to explore the internal and cellular self. Manoj has a glorious sense of humor, intention, and an open heart. He is special, and his classes unique.<\/p><p>Manoj ji had post-graduate degree in Yogic Sciences and human conscious. Manoj ji also had post-graduate diploma in Yogic Sciences and ayurveda from Gurukul Kangri university, Haridwar and certified 500 hrs. teacher training (ERYT) from yoga alliance USA. Manoj teaches classes are a fine synthesis of Holistic Yoga, mantra chanting, dynamic breathing techniques, Prana Kriya, Kundalini Yoga. Manoj was initiated in the tradition of yoga by his guru and shishya tradition Rishikesh Himalayas.\u00a0 In his classes at the yogashala, Manoj teaches elementary yoga practice, mass adjustment in a class setting, gives workshops on asana alignment and adjustment, and tunes his students into the \u201cancient yoga\u201d \u2013 yoga of Compassion and Action. With 25 years of teaching experience, Yogi Manoj is a seasoned and dedicated holistic yoga teacher. His journey into yoga began decades ago, driven by a deep passion for fostering physical, mental, and spiritual well-being. Over the years, Yogi Manoj has honed his skills and knowledge, blending traditional yoga practices with modern holistic approaches to offer a comprehensive and transformative experience for his students.<\/p><p>Yogi Manoj\u2019s teaching philosophy centers on the belief that yoga is not just a physical exercise but a path to inner peace and holistic health. He integrates various styles of yoga, including Hatha, kundalini, prana kriyas and Ashtanga yoga, along with meditation, pranayama, and mindfulness practices, to create a balanced and enriching practice for individuals of all levels.<\/p><p>Throughout his career, Yogi Manoj has inspired countless students to embark on their own journeys of self-discovery and wellness. His classes are known for their inclusive and supportive atmosphere, where students are encouraged to explore their potential and connect with their true selves.<\/p><p>Join Yogi Manoj for a transformative yoga experience that nurtures the body, mind, and soul.<\/p><p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px|||\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_divider divider_position=\"center\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][\/et_pb_divider][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=\"1_4,3_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_column type=\"1_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_image src=\"https:\/\/purnamyogashala.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/amitesh.png\" title_text=\"amitesh\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][\/et_pb_image][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_font=\"Poppins|700|||||||\" text_text_color=\"#ff1d11\" text_font_size=\"16px\" text_letter_spacing=\"1px\" custom_margin=\"-26px||||false|false\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"]<\/p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">YOGI AMITESH<\/h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Yoga Teacher, Sound Healing & Meditation Expert<\/p><p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"3_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_font=\"Jost||||||||\" text_text_color=\"#212529\" text_font_size=\"16px\" text_line_height=\"1.8em\" text_orientation=\"justified\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"]<\/p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Yogi Amitesh is a highly experienced yoga teacher and a renowned expert in sound healing and meditation, boasting 15 years of dedicated practice and teaching. His journey into the world of yoga and holistic healing began with a deep desire to explore the interconnectedness of body, mind, and spirit.<\/p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amitesh believes that learning is a continuous process so the seeker always must have the charm of positivity or enthusiasm to move ahead in yogic path. Professionally, He holds Masters in \u2018Yogic Science\u2019 from Gurukul Kangari University, Haridwar and P.G. Diploma in \u2018Yogic Science\u2019 from HNBGU Srinagar Uttarakhand besides that he also holds diploma in \u2018sound healing.<br \/>Specializing in integrating traditional yoga practices with sound healing and meditation techniques, Yogi Amitesh offers a unique and transformative experience for his students. His sessions are designed to harmonize the body energy, promote inner peace, and enhance overall well-being. Yogi Amitesh\u2019s profound knowledge and gentle guidance have touched the lives of many, helping them to achieve a state of balance and tranquillity. His classes are a sanctuary for those seeking to rejuvenate their mind, body, and soul, combining physical practice with the healing power of sound and the depth of meditation.<\/p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Join Yogi Amitesh for a journey of self-discovery and holistic healing, and experience the profound<br \/>benefits of his integrative approach to yoga, sound healing, and meditation.<\/p><p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" custom_padding=\"0px||0px|||\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_column type=\"4_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_divider divider_position=\"center\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][\/et_pb_divider][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=\"1_4,3_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_column type=\"1_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_image src=\"https:\/\/purnamyogashala.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/07\/master_akshaya.png\" title_text=\"master_akshaya\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][\/et_pb_image][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_font=\"Poppins|700|||||||\" text_text_color=\"#ef1023\" text_font_size=\"15px\" text_letter_spacing=\"1px\" custom_margin=\"-26px||||false|false\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"]<\/p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>Akshaya Yogi<\/b><\/h3><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Ashtanga Yoga, Alignment, and Adjustment<\/p><p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type=\"3_4\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_text _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" text_font=\"Jost||||||||\" text_text_color=\"#212529\" text_font_size=\"16px\" text_line_height=\"1.8em\" text_orientation=\"justified\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"]<\/p><p>Yogi Akshay is a dedicated and experienced yoga teacher specializing in Vinyasa, Ashtanga, and Iyengar yoga techniques. With 10 years of teaching experience, Akshay is known for his deep understanding of alignment and adjustment, ensuring his students achieve optimal posture and balance in their practice.<\/p><p>Yogi Akshay had Post Graduate degree In Yogic science from Uttarakhand Sanskrit University and 500 hours teachers training certificate from yoga alliance. Hailing from the serene and spiritual surroundings of Rishikesh Himalaya, Yogi Akshay incorporates the essence of his homeland into his teaching, bringing a unique blend of tradition and modernity to his classes. His approach is both rigorous and nurturing, providing a comprehensive yoga experience that caters to the needs of each individual student.<\/p><p>Yogi Akshay\u2019s classes are designed to challenge and inspire, promoting physical strength, mental clarity, and spiritual growth. Whether you are a beginner or an advanced practitioner, Akshay\u2019s guidance will help you deepen your practice and connect with your inner self.<\/p><p>Join Yogi Akshay for a transformative journey on the mat, and experience the true essence of yoga.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=\"1\" _builder_version=\"4.27.0\" _module_preset=\"default\" background_color=\"#ff7722\" custom_padding=\"65px||65px||true|false\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_row column_structure=\"2_5,3_5\" use_custom_gutter=\"on\" gutter_width=\"1\" make_equal=\"on\" _builder_version=\"4.16\" _module_preset=\"default\" module_alignment=\"center\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][et_pb_column type=\"2_5\" _builder_version=\"4.16\" _module_preset=\"default\" custom_padding_tablet=\"||80px||false|false\" custom_padding_phone=\"||50px||false|false\" custom_padding_last_edited=\"on|tablet\" custom_css_main_element=\"margin: auto;\" global_colors_info=\"{}\"][dipi_svg_animator src=\"https:\/\/demo.divi-pixel.com\/yoga\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/8\/2021\/12\/yoga-icon-04-w.svg\" svg_width=\"64px\" svg_height=\"64px\" anim_type=\"oneByOne\" anim_dur=\"201\" anim_start=\"inViewport\" replay_on_click=\"on\" _builder_version=\"4.16\" _module_preset=\"default\" width=\"64px\" module_alignment=\"left\" custom_margin=\"||0px||false|false\" custom_padding=\"||0px||fal